    <item>
      <title>Benvenuti a Blowfish</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/welcome/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/welcome/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;lead text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 !mb-9 text-xl&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Blowfish 3 è un tema Hugo moderno per blog, documentazione, portfolio e siti che non rientrano in un modello rigido.&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div&#xA;  &#xA;    class=&#34;flex px-4 py-3 rounded-md shadow bg-primary-100 dark:bg-primary-900&#34;&#xA;  &#xA;  &gt;&#xA;  &lt;span&#xA;    &#xA;      class=&#34;text-primary-400 pe-3 flex items-center&#34;&#xA;    &#xA;    &gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;relative block icon&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 512 512&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;currentColor&#34; d=&#34;M506.3 417l-213.3-364c-16.33-28-57.54-28-73.98 0l-213.2 364C-10.59 444.9 9.849 480 42.74 480h426.6C502.1 480 522.6 445 506.3 417zM232 168c0-13.25 10.75-24 24-24S280 154.8 280 168v128c0 13.25-10.75 24-23.1 24S232 309.3 232 296V168zM256 416c-17.36 0-31.44-14.08-31.44-31.44c0-17.36 14.07-31.44 31.44-31.44s31.44 14.08 31.44 31.44C287.4 401.9 273.4 416 256 416z&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &lt;span&#xA;    &#xA;      class=&#34;dark:text-neutral-300&#34;&#xA;    &#xA;    &gt;Crea un nuovo sito con &lt;code&gt;npx blowfish-tools new &amp;lt;site&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;, quindi segui la &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/it/docs/installation/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;guida all&amp;rsquo;installazione&lt;/a&gt;. I siti Blowfish esistenti possono passare a v3 senza modifiche incompatibili alla configurazione.&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Crea il sito che hai in mente&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;crea-il-sito-che-hai-in-mente&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#crea-il-sito-che-hai-in-mente&#34; aria-label=&#34;Ancora&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Blowfish offre una solida base di partenza senza fissare il risultato. Scegli layout homepage profilo, landing, hero, a schede o con sfondo. Imposta colori, tipografia, navigazione, modalità scura e presentazione degli articoli dalla configurazione del sito. Usa il front matter quando una pagina deve essere diversa.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="http://localhost:1313/docs/welcome/featured.svg" />
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Installazione</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/installation/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/installation/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Segui semplicemente la procedura standard &lt;a href=&#34;https://gohugo.io/getting-started/quick-start/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;Avvio Rapido&lt;/a&gt; di Hugo per iniziare subito.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Sono riportate le istruzioni dettagliate per l&amp;rsquo;installazione. Sono disponibili anche le istruzioni per &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/it/docs/installation/#installazione-degli-aggiornamenti&#34; &gt;aggiornare il tema&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Skill per agenti&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;skill-per-agenti&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#skill-per-agenti&#34; aria-label=&#34;Ancora&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Blowfish include una &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/nunocoracao/blowfish/tree/main/.claude/skills/blowfish&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;skill per agenti&lt;/a&gt; che insegna agli agenti di programmazione IA — come Claude Code — come installare, configurare e creare siti con il tema. Se usi un agente per lavorare sul tuo sito, installa la skill così conoscerà i file di configurazione, i layout, il front matter e gli shortcode di Blowfish.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="http://localhost:1313/docs/installation/featured.svg" />
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Per iniziare</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/per-iniziare/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/per-iniziare/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div&#xA;  &#xA;    class=&#34;flex px-4 py-3 rounded-md shadow bg-primary-100 dark:bg-primary-900&#34;&#xA;  &#xA;  &gt;&#xA;  &lt;span&#xA;    &#xA;      class=&#34;text-primary-400 pe-3 flex items-center&#34;&#xA;    &#xA;    &gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;relative block icon&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 512 512&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;currentColor&#34; d=&#34;M506.3 417l-213.3-364c-16.33-28-57.54-28-73.98 0l-213.2 364C-10.59 444.9 9.849 480 42.74 480h426.6C502.1 480 522.6 445 506.3 417zM232 168c0-13.25 10.75-24 24-24S280 154.8 280 168v128c0 13.25-10.75 24-23.1 24S232 309.3 232 296V168zM256 416c-17.36 0-31.44-14.08-31.44-31.44c0-17.36 14.07-31.44 31.44-31.44s31.44 14.08 31.44 31.44C287.4 401.9 273.4 416 256 416z&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &lt;span&#xA;    &#xA;      class=&#34;dark:text-neutral-300&#34;&#xA;    &#xA;    &gt;Questa sezione presuppone che tu abbia già &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/it/docs/installation/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;installato il tema Blowfish&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div&#xA;  &#xA;    class=&#34;flex px-4 py-3 rounded-md shadow bg-primary-100 dark:bg-primary-900&#34;&#xA;  &#xA;  &gt;&#xA;  &lt;span&#xA;    &#xA;      class=&#34;text-primary-400 pe-3 flex items-center&#34;&#xA;    &#xA;    &gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;relative block icon&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 576 512&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;path fill=&#34;currentColor&#34; d=&#34;M234.7 42.7L197 56.8c-3 1.1-5 4-5 7.2s2 6.1 5 7.2l37.7 14.1L248.8 123c1.1 3 4 5 7.2 5s6.1-2 7.2-5l14.1-37.7L315 71.2c3-1.1 5-4 5-7.2s-2-6.1-5-7.2L277.3 42.7 263.2 5c-1.1-3-4-5-7.2-5s-6.1 2-7.2 5L234.7 42.7zM46.1 395.4c-18.7 18.7-18.7 49.1 0 67.9l34.6 34.6c18.7 18.7 49.1 18.7 67.9 0L529.9 116.5c18.7-18.7 18.7-49.1 0-67.9L495.3 14.1c-18.7-18.7-49.1-18.7-67.9 0L46.1 395.4zM484.6 82.6l-105 105-23.3-23.3 105-105 23.3 23.3zM7.5 117.2C3 118.9 0 123.2 0 128s3 9.1 7.5 10.8L64 160l21.2 56.5c1.7 4.5 6 7.5 10.8 7.5s9.1-3 10.8-7.5L128 160l56.5-21.2c4.5-1.7 7.5-6 7.5-10.8s-3-9.1-7.5-10.8L128 96 106.8 39.5C105.1 35 100.8 32 96 32s-9.1 3-10.8 7.5L64 96 7.5 117.2zm352 256c-4.5 1.7-7.5 6-7.5 10.8s3 9.1 7.5 10.8L416 416l21.2 56.5c1.7 4.5 6 7.5 10.8 7.5s9.1-3 10.8-7.5L480 416l56.5-21.2c4.5-1.7 7.5-6 7.5-10.8s-3-9.1-7.5-10.8L480 352l-21.2-56.5c-1.7-4.5-6-7.5-10.8-7.5s-9.1 3-10.8 7.5L416 352l-56.5 21.2z&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &lt;span&#xA;    &#xA;      class=&#34;dark:text-neutral-300&#34;&#xA;    &#xA;    &gt;Lavori con un agente di programmazione IA? Blowfish include una &lt;strong&gt;skill per agenti&lt;/strong&gt; che insegna ad agenti come Claude Code a installare, configurare e usare il tema — consulta la &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/it/docs/installation/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;pagina di installazione&lt;/a&gt; per configurarla.&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I file di configurazione forniti con Blowfish contengono tutte le possibili impostazioni riconosciute dal tema. Per impostazione predefinita, molti di questi sono commentati ma puoi semplicemente decommentarli per attivare o modificare una funzionalità specifica.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="http://localhost:1313/docs/getting-started/featured.svg" />
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Configurazione</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/configurazioni/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/configurazioni/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Blowfish è un tema altamente personalizzabile e utilizza alcune delle più recenti funzionalità di Hugo per semplificarne la configurazione.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Il tema viene fornito con una configurazione predefinita che ti consente di essere operativo con un blog di base o un sito Web statico.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="http://localhost:1313/docs/configuration/featured.svg" />
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Homepage Layout</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/homepage-layout/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/homepage-layout/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Blowfish fornisce layout flessibili per la home page, con impostazioni per adattare ciascun design. In alternativa, puoi anche fornire il tuo modello e avere il controllo completo sul contenuto della home page.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="http://localhost:1313/docs/homepage-layout/featured.svg" />
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Shortcodes</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/shortcodes/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/shortcodes/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;In addition to all the &lt;a href=&#34;https://gohugo.io/content-management/shortcodes/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;default Hugo shortcodes&lt;/a&gt;, Blowfish adds a few extras for additional functionality.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Accordion&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;accordion&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#accordion&#34; aria-label=&#34;Ancora&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;accordion&lt;/code&gt; creates a collapsible set of panels. Use the &lt;code&gt;accordionItem&lt;/code&gt; sub-shortcode to define each item. You can control whether multiple items can be open at the same time using the &lt;code&gt;mode&lt;/code&gt; parameter.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="http://localhost:1313/docs/shortcodes/featured.svg" />
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Front Matter</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/front-matter/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/front-matter/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Oltre ai &lt;a href=&#34;https://gohugo.io/content-management/front-matter/#front-matter-variables&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;parametri predefiniti della parte frontale di Hugo&lt;/a&gt;, Blowfish aggiunge una serie di opzioni aggiuntive per personalizzare la presentazione dei singoli articoli . Tutti i parametri disponibili per la parte frontale del tema sono elencati di seguito.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="http://localhost:1313/docs/front-matter/featured.svg" />
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Multiple Authors</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/multi-author/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/multi-author/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Some websites have more than one author contributing with content and therefore require more than a single default author across the entire website. For those use-cases, Blowfish allows users to extend the list of authors using the multiple authors feature.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="http://localhost:1313/docs/multi-author/featured.svg" />
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Partials</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/partials/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/partials/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Analytics&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;analytics&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#analytics&#34; aria-label=&#34;Ancora&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Blowfish provides built-in support for Fathom Analytics and Google Analytics. Fathom is a paid alternative to Google Analytics that respects user privacy.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="http://localhost:1313/docs/partials/featured.svg" />
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Thumbnails</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/thumbnails/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/thumbnails/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Thumbnails&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;thumbnails&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#thumbnails&#34; aria-label=&#34;Ancora&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Blowfish was enhanced in order to make it easy to add visual support to your posts. To do so, you just need to place an image file (almost all formats are supported but we recommend &lt;code&gt;.png&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;.jpg&lt;/code&gt;) that starts with &lt;code&gt;feature*&lt;/code&gt; inside your article&amp;rsquo;s main directory, as shown in the example below.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="http://localhost:1313/docs/thumbnails/featured.svg" />
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Content Examples</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/content-examples/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/content-examples/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;If you&amp;rsquo;ve been reading the documentation in order, you should now know about all the features and configurations available in Blowfish. This page is designed to pull everything together and offer some worked examples that you might like to use in your Hugo project.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="http://localhost:1313/docs/content-examples/featured.svg" />
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Series</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/series/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/series/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Blowfish provides a feature to group a set of articles together under a &amp;ldquo;series&amp;rdquo;. Placing an article under a series will display the rest of the series articles in each single page and provide a quick way to navigate amongst them. You can see an example of this above.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="http://localhost:1313/docs/series/featured.svg" />
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Advanced Customisation</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/advanced-customisation/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/advanced-customisation/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;There are many ways you can make advanced changes to Blowfish. Read below to learn more about what can be customised and the best way of achieving your desired result.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="http://localhost:1313/docs/advanced-customisation/featured.svg" />
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Hosting &amp; Deployment</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/hosting-deployment/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/hosting-deployment/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;There are many ways to deploy your Hugo website built with Blowfish. The theme is designed to be flexible in almost any deployment scenario.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Blowfish is built using relative URLs throughout the theme. This enables sites to easily be deployed to sub-folders and hosts like GitHub Pages. There&amp;rsquo;s usually no special configuration required for this to work as long as the &lt;code&gt;baseURL&lt;/code&gt; parameter has been configured in the &lt;code&gt;hugo.toml&lt;/code&gt; file.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="http://localhost:1313/docs/hosting-deployment/featured.svg" />
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Firebase: Views &amp; Likes</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/firebase-views/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/it/docs/firebase-views/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;In order to be able to support dynamic data across your website we&amp;rsquo;ve added the support to integrate Firebase. This will allow you to use the views feature across lists and posts.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="http://localhost:1313/docs/firebase-views/featured.svg" />
    </item>
    
